# RescueFlow AI -- optional environment variables. Copy to `.env` if your
# shell/tooling loads it; nothing here is required for prompt 1's CLI/tests.
# NEVER put a real API key or secret in a committed file -- `.env` is
# gitignored; this file holds only documented variable NAMES.

# Path to a SUMO installation (folder containing bin/ and tools/). If unset,
# rescueflow.sumo.env auto-detects common Windows install locations and PATH.
# SUMO_HOME=C:\Program Files (x86)\SUMO

# Stage 3 (not used by prompt 1): enables a genuine LLM-backed EventInterpreter
# instead of the rule-based parser. Absence of this key must never block the
# CLI or benchmark -- see docs/CONTRACTS.md 9.1.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
